          "details": "Move the proximity-specific state and behavior used by isCloseToStartOrEnd(Vertex), including fromEnvelope, toEnvelope, getEnvelope(Coordinate, int), and the calculations using Coordinate, Envelope, and SphericalDistanceLibrary. Keep RouteRequest.from(), setFrom(GenericLocation), to(), setTo(GenericLocation), and the public isCloseToStartOrEnd(Vertex) compatibility method; the latter delegates to the extracted responsibility. RouteRequest will continue to reference GenericLocation and Vertex, but it will no longer directly reference Coordinate, Envelope, or SphericalDistanceLibrary. The target gains one dependency on RouteRequestLocationProximity while eliminating three distinct outgoing dependencies, for an expected net Fan-Out reduction of two.",
          "risk": "medium"
        },
